{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act42side_level_act42side_04_end",
  "groupId": "act42side",
  "stageId": "act42side_04",
  "title": "求道",
  "storyCode": "MT-4",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act42side/level_act42side_04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "7e265f56cb9e3cab0d1fc2aa21b31203b1f495efc26436d4761d1d1962a0905f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "61_g1_nurserytemplesquare"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣堂巡卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这位公民，如果你是来观摩降生仪式的，请去广场那边的等候通道接受检查。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣堂巡卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我看你在附近观望很久了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，对不起！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是在等人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣堂巡卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "圣堂巡卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1788_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天进出圣堂的人流量很大，请配合我们的工作，不要在此过多逗留。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对不起！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "61_g1_nurserytemplesquare"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小乐姐已经进去整整一天了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "按照原计划，她只需要炸毁圣堂里的重要建筑结构，让那个什么仪式没法如期举办就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个时间点，她应该已经出来了才对......难道被发现了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不对不对，我一直守在这附近，里面明明什么动静都没有......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管怎么样，小乐姐肯定遇到了一些意外，没法脱身......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梵妮，快想想快想想，你能做点什么！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "61_g1_nurserytemplesquare"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我身上还剩两小管源石火药，可以组装成一个简易炸弹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然实际的威力可能没那么大，但足够搞出一些动静，吸引那些卫兵的注意力，让小乐姐能够......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就安在这里好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼——暂时没人注意到这里，那么只需要引爆——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一截铳管托住了梵里妮的手臂，她没能再往下移动哪怕一寸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别让这小玩意“砰”出声，孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "慢慢站起身来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "铳、铳骑......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看你这身装扮，你是铳械工坊的工匠？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还有十分钟的空闲时间。孩子，可以向我解释清楚这一切吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想做什么？或者说，你在给谁打掩护？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "61_g12_firearmsworkshop"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走吧，小乐姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_1041_angel2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "潘大师呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老师已经睡下了。他最近视力又变差了，医生叮嘱他早点休息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们动作轻点，应该不会吵醒他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_1041_angel2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梵妮，先别急。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小乐姐，你干嘛这么一本正经地说话，好、好不习惯啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_1041_angel2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳，听着——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_1041_angel2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你不小心被逮住了，不管对方是戍卫队、执行者，还是铳骑，千万不要讲什么义气，直接把我供出来就好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_1041_angel2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你只是在一个月黑风高的晚上突然被我踹开门胁迫着做了一些炸弹，被我逼着在圣堂外面望望风而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_1041_angel2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你什么都不知情，只是一个无辜的小天使！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_1041_angel2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是我答应你跟我一起行动的条件哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小乐姐，我只是有点怕生，并不是胆小！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_1041_angel2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈我知道。你愿意帮我，我已经很开心了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_1041_angel2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "教皇厅好像非常非常看重那个仪式，很难说因此触犯律法的人，会受到什么样的惩罚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_1041_angel2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "更何况现在的拉特兰，和我记忆中的很不一样了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_1041_angel2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了好了，我一个人就够了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_1041_angel2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再说了，企鹅物流的企业文化是——能一个人出的风头绝不分给两个人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "61_g1_nurserytemplesquare"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（摇头）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我是一个人来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有趣的孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我这样的老家伙，和年轻人聊天的机会不多。可惜，仪式就要开始了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不肯说的话，我只能将你移交给公证所的执行者了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "帕特里奇昂，住手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别以为你躲在铁皮壳子里，我就看不到你假惺惺的嘴脸了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳......咳，跑死我了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "潘？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "26_g10_laterano_roof"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，圣城的异样啊什么的，你们俩好像突然之间就心领神会了......你们不打算跟我解释一下吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这与我们的调查没有关系，修女。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我暂时无法作出你应当知晓更多事情的判断。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管怎么样，阿尔图罗小姐，请跟我们回去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "实话说，我并不讨厌，甚至有些喜欢你。但如果你让兰登修道院受到损害，我、我不会放过你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "席德佳修女，可以问你一个问题吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你深爱着修道院，深爱着拉特兰，对吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或者我应该这么问，作为黎博利，你是如何建立起与拉特兰的情感联系的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......我在兰登修道院生活很久了，从小就受修道院的叔叔阿姨们照顾，我们一起做面包酿啤酒，为了修道院不破产东奔西走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我属于这里，我当然爱这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你是问为什么圣城会有那么多黎博利......阿尔图罗小姐，你读过那本《圣徒行记》的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "难道说，你只是拿它折了纸蜻蜓......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "按照《圣徒行记》的说法，黎博利与拉特兰的相遇，其实要从一群驮兽讲起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知道多少年前，几十个黎博利在荒野上寻觅水源时被一群驮兽冲散，那些动物背负着成捆的粮食，结成整齐的队伍奔向远方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黎博利为了猎杀驮兽，往往要费很多很多功夫，他们从未见过这些属于荒野的精灵如此有迹可循，便一路尾随着它们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然后，黎博利看见了田地间头顶光环的人们，他们一边唱着歌，一边收拢着驮兽队伍，走入身后洁白的建筑群中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在黎博利还衣不蔽体，只能逐水草而居的时候，那群人便已经学会了驯化野生动物，建造不受天灾侵袭的城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "更重要的是，黎博利发现那群人还有着他们难以理解的自信和乐观。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因为光环，因为“共感”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们生来便能互相感受，互相理解，因此少有矛盾。他们能够解决一切足以摧毁荒野上其他族群的危机。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们由此建立起了完善的秩序，以“律法”为名。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我能明白那种感觉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的记忆里，尽管教皇厅已经断了对修道院的补助，尽管房屋已经残破不堪，尽管我无数次对着厚厚的账本发愁......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但萨科塔叔叔阿姨们好像从来没有想过，兰登修道院真有倒闭的一天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们的自信与乐观，甚至让他们能够接纳不属于族群的黎博利留在附近，学习他们的一切，成为他们的一部分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，漫长的时间里，除了光环无法分享，萨科塔几乎已经完全同化了圣城里的黎博利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们太过特别，特别到能够吸纳一切......就像一首主调清晰的协奏曲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "费迪，从一开始，拉特兰便不只是萨科塔们的温馨小屋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你越狱后专门去移动修道院打探“失踪的孕妇”——我查看过公证所的资料，近期并无失踪人口相关的报案记录。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿尔图罗，你需要对该行为进行解释。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一位可怜的母亲消失在了拉特兰，这是一起无人会在意的失踪案......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因极其偶然的机会，我曾在麦田间演奏时，触碰到她的心声——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我终于查到她去了哪里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是说......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别急。等等看，费迪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿尔图罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "已经到了这里，不需要我来为你说明了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "61_g1_nurserytemplesquare"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是后来你收养的那个孩子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对不住了，铳骑大人，我身上可没带领养文件。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么，只许你收养黎博利，不许我收养萨科塔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这可是个好孩子。反正除了你之外，我倒是没发现和萨科塔交心有这么难。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你这张嘴啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "潘，我们有多久没见面了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "忘了，没往前想过。不过我本来以为往后也是没必要的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那么，言归正传吧。你的学徒刚刚试图——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我指使她来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "目的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "示威啊，很难理解吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "教皇厅一口气关停了全城上百间铳械工坊，我干了几十年的活计，我指望养老的那间小铺子，就这么稀里糊涂地没了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听说今天你们要在这里开派对，我寻思整点动静，让贵宾们听个响，让教皇厅给我这个公民一点说法！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说实话，我本来该自己来的，但年纪大了腿脚不利索了眼神不灵光了，只好让这孩子跑一遭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "潘，我以为你早就改行了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，拉倒吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "吉雅被你赶出拉特兰后，你到如今还敢用着我做的这把铳，我为什么要改行？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是不再专门为你们这些铳骑服务了而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这件事，你打算怎么处理？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在育婴圣堂前搞爆炸，试图破坏降生仪式，被你抓个现行......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为了保证乐园的纯洁，身为铳骑的你，是不是应该再一次把自己的朋友“送”出拉特兰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好巧不巧，他又是一个黎博利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这和你是不是黎博利没有关系，潘。如果你们真的触犯了律法，我恐怕得再体验一次离别。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但这不是发现得及时，没有酿成实质性的后果嘛，哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "带你的学徒回去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走了，梵妮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（扶着我点，出门很急，忘了换你帮我新配的眼镜了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铳骑",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阁下，这人的说法明显站不住脚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铳骑",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "依照最稳妥的做法，我们应该将这对师生一并带回审问，排除风险......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没必要这么大费周章......而且，我确实不想和那个老家伙再起冲突。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看这个粗糙的小炸弹，那孩子显然是临时起意......也就是说，她的同伙还在里面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再调一队铳骑过来，配合圣堂巡卫布防。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铳骑",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "61_g1_nurserytemplesquare"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......奇怪，难道还在育婴圣堂里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿摩斯辅佐官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "帕特里奇昂阁下......好、好久不见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好久不见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看你着急忙慌的样子，怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您看到蕾缪安枢机了吗？我有点事情想要向她确认。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她来育婴圣堂公干，一直没有返回第七厅......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果是和那场爆炸有关，你需要向我同步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "此前去接收法柏尔区博尔戈街的铳械工坊时，我偶遇了一位萨科塔，后来向枢机汇报时，她明显察觉到了一些异样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "根据那人的外形特征，我比对了所有在籍公民的信息，在外出人员资料库里发现了一个相符的人选。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那人应该也在此前司提望区的爆炸现场出现过。她......她和枢机存在一些特别的关联。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4194_rmixer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "26_g5_laterano_chapelout"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我的时间不多，修女，我得尽快赶回育婴圣堂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_369_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "容我最后确认，您并不确定照顾的对象会死亡，却打算提前为她预订一场葬礼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的......她的情况不容乐观，身为保育员，我当竭尽所能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但这并不妨碍我做最悲观的打算。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_369_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这样的行事风格，真不像个拉特兰人啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉特兰人，应该是什么样子的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_369_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......还真是个费脑筋的问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么，再见——不，希望我们不需要再见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_357_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们通知我的时候我还不信——安多恩，你居然真的回到了这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_357_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这间安魂教堂，这片鸢尾花田，熟悉吗？或者说，怀念吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉特兰的安魂教堂数量并不算少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至于说怀念......我现在的工作，恐怕不适合对安魂教堂有这样的情绪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_357_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我都忘了，你现在可是最受器重的保育员！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，请问您是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前跟踪我的，潜入圣堂袭击我的，都是你们？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_357_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“跟踪”？“袭击”？安多恩，是你疯了还是我疯了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_357_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果不希望我们与你同路，当初又为什么要把“寻路者”之名交予我们？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_357_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那座吃人不眨眼的诡异圣堂，究竟是你寻得的正道，还是你误入的歧途？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在遇到牧首之前，我并不记得曾承诺过与谁同路......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至于育婴圣堂，它确实为我指明了一条道路。但“吃人不眨眼”？你一定是误解了什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_357_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行了，安多恩，别*拉特兰俚语*装傻！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_357_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们的十几位手足再也没能走出那座圣堂！如果你寻得的路途需要我们牺牲，你至少应该提前告诉我们......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_357_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或者，如果你真的无耻到只是想否认我们之间的联系，那你也至少应该直接说出来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我不明白......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_357_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你接下来有的是时间慢慢搞明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请别这样做，有很多孩子需要我照顾，还有那位母亲......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "26_g5_laterano_chapelout"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "26_g5_laterano_chapelout"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_357_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳，嘶——该死！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_357_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是她们，先撤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "菲亚梅塔，你开炮的时候真没想到要避开安多恩啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亚梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他向来命大，死不了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "菲亚梅塔，莫斯提马......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亚梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安多恩，看来你的仇人还真不少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我去追，你和他聊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不必了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然不明白这群人为什么屡次对我下手，但我隐隐觉得......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们很坚定。这样的人一般都有着复杂的经历与单纯的渴求。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亚梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你还真有慈悲心啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亚梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那为什么能对自己的队友下那样的狠手呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亚梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么你不肯对莫斯提马和蕾缪安忏悔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亚梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么你不肯告诉我们，当年在地宫深处，锁与匙里的那个家伙究竟让你看到了什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亚梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么，你从来不肯告诉我们答案？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "准确说，是和我们分享问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......菲亚梅塔，我们都有自己的路要走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亚梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的路，就是指发疯打伤蕾缪安，不负责任地逃走，再突然跟着那个牧首回来，心安理得地躲在育婴圣堂接受她的庇佑？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亚梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你消失的那几年，究竟得到了什么救赎，啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不曾得到救赎，也从不心安理得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是生命太过短暂，如果不能及早找到我所求的答案，我的罪行与你们的伤痛都会变得毫无意义。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从兰登修道院刑满释放的第二天，我就离开了拉特兰，自以为能寻得些什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对于之后五年里发生的事，我印象很模糊，只记得自己去到一个地方，再到下一个地方，一个人，很多不知终点的方向......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我时常怀疑，是不是自己的记忆出了问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亚梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所幸我遇到了牧首。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她那时正在前往圣城的旅途之中，虽然已经因一路救死扶伤而耽搁了不知多少时日。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是她让我相信，答案仍在拉特兰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她向我许诺，一个奇迹，而后千千万万的奇迹，将因我们而诞生。我回到拉特兰，只为与她共同履行这诺言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亚梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你还是别说了。颠三倒四，自说自话，烦死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亚梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听着，安多恩。那天的聚会，我把你赶了出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亚梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之后帕特里奇昂花了很长的时间，试图告诉我——你，你们那座圣堂，你们即将举办的那场仪式的重要性啊什么的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亚梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我从来没见老头子那么正式过，所以我答应了他，暂时不和你计较。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亚梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "救你，不是因为我原谅了你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亚梅塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_300_phenxi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是在你为当年的事情真正忏悔并付出代价之前，你没有资格死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "speakerId": "avg_213_mostma_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安多恩，降生仪式快开始了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，我得走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "61_g2_baptismlobby"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......晨安。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "诸位同胞、归乡的信使、来自泰拉诸国的使者、经由修道院第一次踏入圣城的客人们，请允许我向你们致意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们身处的这座圣堂，并非拉特兰为了迎合“万国峰会”，故作姿态地展示财力与奇观而建。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但它能赶在这一盛事期间落成，能让各位今天齐聚于此，我感到由衷的喜悦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "每一次新生，都会带来全新的可能......关于如何延续信仰，关于如何对抗灾异。唯有如此，我们才能塑造未来的形貌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在今后的拉特兰，更是如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希望大家做好准备，聆听新的心跳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
